{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧第一块超大白字，紫色强调词“忘了藏好喜欢”“看出他有多在乎”最容易先吸引视线；随后下方第二块同样醒目的大字也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他这次没藏住喜欢，对方看出了他有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定。第一块能看到喜欢和在乎，但还不能直接判断他此刻是失落、害怕还是不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"被看出来之后，他心里空落落的，担心对方嫌自己太黏，以及两人的亲近感反而像隔了一层。这些信息主要在第二块。小字中的幸福是否真实、终于能深吸一口气，也不是第一眼能稳定抓到的内容。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大字字号、亮度接近，都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心处境和具体感受分布在两块文字中，需要把上块的喜欢被看见与下块的失落、担忧拼起来。\",\n    \"两块都是较长的复合句，各自包含时间对比、处境和多层心理信息。\",\n    \"第一块放大的强调词能说明喜欢和在乎，但单独说不出人物此刻的情绪状态。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d182fa70-7992-4960-9c51-865ef4d4c228", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011056303352Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:11:42.577216+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "532a5936b3257972fb114e33a102960eb5bafdd391bf5f53ac5903ec6d51dfb2", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp